      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$4-\\frac{9}{2}=5-\\frac{9}{2}$； $4=5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1081",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1081. 求满足方程 $x^2-y^2=69$ 的所有自然数对。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1082",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1082. 证明表示式 $\\sqrt{11+6\\sqrt{2}}+\\sqrt{11-6\\sqrt{2}}$ 的值是自然",
        "数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1083",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1083. 设 $a\\geqslant0$，$b\\geqslant0$，$c\\geqslant0$，$d\\geqslant0$，证明：不等式",
        "$\\sqrt{(a+c)(b+d)}\\geqslant\\sqrt{ab}+\\sqrt{cd}$ 成立。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1084",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1084. 证明：$a+b\\sqrt{2}$（$a\\in Q$，$b\\in Q$）这种形式的数的和、",
        "差、积、商也可以写成同样的形式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1085",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1085. 已知方程 $(x+y\\sqrt{2})(x-y\\sqrt{2})=1$ 的解是： $x=3$，",
        "$y=2$。证明存在任意多个满足这个方程的其它自然数",
        "对。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1086",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1086. 把表示式 $x^8+x^4-1$ 分解成 $4$ 个因式，使其中每一个因",
        "式都含有变量。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1087",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1087. 方程 $x^2+px+1=0$ 的根的平方和等于 $254$。求系数",
        "$P$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1088",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1088. $a$ 是什么数时，方程 $x^2+(a-1)x-2a=0$ 的根的平方",
        "和等于 $9$？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1089",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1089. 证明：在周长一定的所有矩形当中，正方形具有最大",
        "的面积。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1030",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1030. 证明：当用 $30$ 去除质数时，在余数里得到质数或 $1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1091",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1091. 汽艇顺流行驶，从码头 $A$ 到 $B$ 需用 $8$ 小时，而从 $B$ 到",
        "$A$ 逆流行驶需用 $10$ 小时。乘坐木排从 $A$ 到 $B$ 需要多少",
        "小时？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1092",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1092. 一种合金由锌和铜组成，其中含锌和铜的比例为 $1:2$；",
        "另一种含同样金属元素的合金，比例为 $2:3$。这两种合"
      ]
    },
